  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {出資|しゅっし}{者|しゃ} - investor, contributor\n- {出資|しゅっし}{金|きん} - investment capital\n- {出資|しゅっし}{比率|ひりつ} - investment ratio\n- {共同|きょうどう}{出資|しゅっし} - joint investment\n- {出資|しゅっし}を{募|つの}る - to seek investment\n\nBUSINESS CONTEXT:\nUsed in business/corporate contexts to describe contributing capital to a company.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {投資|とうし} - investment (more general, includes stocks)\n- {融資|ゆうし} - financing, loan (lending money)",
